                <mxCell id="41" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;A/B Testing and Shadow Deployment Flow for Model Evaluation&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;178&quot; data-start=&quot;148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;178&quot; data-start=&quot;152&quot;&gt;User inference traffic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;238&quot; data-start=&quot;179&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;238&quot; data-start=&quot;179&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;238&quot; data-start=&quot;181&quot;&gt;Incoming user requests are captured for model evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;284&quot; data-start=&quot;245&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;284&quot; data-start=&quot;249&quot;&gt;Model A (Best or current model)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;377&quot; data-start=&quot;285&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;321&quot; data-start=&quot;285&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;321&quot; data-start=&quot;287&quot;&gt;The model currently in production.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;377&quot; data-start=&quot;322&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;377&quot; data-start=&quot;324&quot;&gt;Used to generate predictions that users actually see.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;429&quot; data-start=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;429&quot; data-start=&quot;388&quot;&gt;Model B (2nd best or candidate model)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;556&quot; data-start=&quot;430&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;474&quot; data-start=&quot;430&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;474&quot; data-start=&quot;432&quot;&gt;A newer or alternative model being tested.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;556&quot; data-start=&quot;475&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;556&quot; data-start=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Also processes the same input as Model A but without affecting user experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;592&quot; data-start=&quot;563&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;592&quot; data-start=&quot;567&quot;&gt;Feature Flags / NGINX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;715&quot; data-start=&quot;593&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;635&quot; data-start=&quot;593&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;635&quot; data-start=&quot;595&quot;&gt;Controls which model(s) receive traffic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;715&quot; data-start=&quot;636&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;715&quot; data-start=&quot;638&quot;&gt;Enables routing logic like A/B testing, shadow testing, or canary deployment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;742&quot; data-start=&quot;722&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;742&quot; data-start=&quot;726&quot;&gt;Shadow model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;858&quot; data-start=&quot;743&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;805&quot; data-start=&quot;743&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;805&quot; data-start=&quot;745&quot;&gt;Model that runs in the background using the same input data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;858&quot; data-start=&quot;806&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;858&quot; data-start=&quot;808&quot;&gt;Its predictions are logged but not shown to users.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;891&quot; data-start=&quot;865&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;891&quot; data-start=&quot;869&quot;&gt;Log User Responses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;976&quot; data-start=&quot;892&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;976&quot; data-start=&quot;892&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;976&quot; data-start=&quot;894&quot;&gt;Captures how users reacted to predictions (e.g., clicks, confirmations, behavior).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1006&quot; data-start=&quot;983&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1006&quot; data-start=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Log Predictions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1070&quot; data-start=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1070&quot; data-start=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1070&quot; data-start=&quot;1009&quot;&gt;Stores the predictions made by all models (A, B, and shadow).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1101&quot; data-start=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1101&quot; data-start=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;Log Ground Truth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1216&quot; data-start=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1216&quot; data-start=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1216&quot; data-start=&quot;1104&quot;&gt;Logs the correct answer or outcome (ground truth), once known (e.g., actual product purchased, final diagnosis).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1276&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1276&quot; data-start=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;Compare live performance (Model A vs Model B)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1418&quot; data-start=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1361&quot; data-start=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1304&quot; data-start=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Evaluate models based on:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1361&quot; data-start=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1338&quot; data-start=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1338&quot; data-start=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;Accuracy against ground truth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1361&quot; data-start=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1361&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;Real user behavior&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1418&quot; data-start=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1418&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot;&gt;Helps decide whether to promote Model B to production.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1070" y="-50" width="410" height="1300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>